CHAPTER.VERS:
And it will come to pass, when Pharaoh will call you

          {+}
        , and will say, What is your

          {+}
         occupation?

Then you

          {+}
         will say, Your slaves have been keepers of cattle from our youth even until now, both we, and our fathers: that you

          {+}
         may dwell in the land of Goshen; for every shepherd is disgusting to the Egyptians.
